{"reviews":[{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-0","r":1.0,"t":"Just stick to the legit ones","x":"I received my sponges earlier than expected, which was nice. But I'm still giving this product only one star because when damping the sponge it does not expand. It also has this really bad smell to it and that smell transfers onto your face! I swear after doing my make up with these sponges I could that weird rubber smell from the sponges on my face. Also these sponges do not help spread your fondation evenly nor smoothly. Spend your money the legit ones because these are crap!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great for me and greater for my kids' makeup play...does not expand with water though","x":"[[VIDEOID:cb85f98645ff044e50cef6ce3c677408]] I ordered these makeup blenders after I got a similar one in a monthly beauty box I subscribe to. I really love that makeup blender, but my kids keep wanting to take it to play with it. So I jumped on Amazon to buy another. Well, the namebrand one is too expensive to buy as a toy for my kids...probably even too expensive to me to buy for myself as a backup! So when I found these, I was stoked.  These do not expand with water, but they are very dense a","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-2","r":3.0,"t":"Tiny tiny!!","x":"These are very tiny! Good for application under the eyes, maybe.  Too tiny to use for blending on face.  Quality is fine, size is their biggest flaw.  Slow to arrive.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-3","r":4.0,"t":"They are pretty small, but they still work well","x":"They are pretty small, but they still work well. They came a little earlier than the expected day said, which was nice. They are super soft and I think they work well to distribute make up. For the price they are AWESOME","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-4","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome buy","x":"I like these a lot. They are a bit smaller than the others I've tried before so they get in all the curves and tiny corners of my face! Good quality also so they will be lasting me a while!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-5","r":3.0,"t":"Not the best","x":"IteM works as well as the price paid .. Shipping was super fast but I recommend buying it someplace else","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-6","r":5.0,"t":"Yes!","x":"Very soft to the touch, small in size (which I actually really like!) perfect for applying consealors or even contours. Arrived sooner than I expected according to arrival date.. Took a bit to receive though. I think I'll sock up on them. Can't beat the price. Profucts is better than what it's priced at IMO. I've paid more for blenders that are nowhere near as well made!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-7","r":5.0,"t":"Works as it suppose to do","x":"Nice product. They are small, but good to apply any lotion or foundation. The color keep unchanged after wash. For foundation, the result is not as good as my beauty blender (which is $20 from Sephora). Still ok. Price is much cheaper. For lotion, works good.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great beauty makeup sponges!","x":"These little makeup sponges are wonderful.  Easy for liquid foundation or to blend with. I like the shape as you can turn to small end to get near your eyes. Plus they are a great deal!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-9","r":1.0,"t":"I do not recommend this product","x":"I do not recommend this product. All the sponges smell like piss, even after I washed them. They must have lots of chemicals, I had to throw them to the trash. Never buying this again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-10","r":5.0,"t":"Love them!","x":"I love these beauty blenders. They are soft and they are easy to use. I love how they are different colors. They are also easy to clean as well. My make up goes on smoothly!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-11","r":2.0,"t":"unpleasant odor","x":"Each blender in the pack had a burnt rubber/ plastic odor (almost gasoline-like if I try to exactly describe it) that even soaking overnight in cleanser did not remove.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-12","r":2.0,"t":"but it would be nice to add a disclaimer on the product stating it ...","x":"This product irritates my skin. To be fair I do have sensitive skin, but it would be nice to add a disclaimer on the product stating it could irritate sensitive skin.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-13","r":4.0,"t":"It was great. I also didn't think it'd be small but ...","x":"Wasn't expecting this to arrive two weeks prior to the predicted arrival date. It was great. I also didn't think it'd be small but it still works fine.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-14","r":1.0,"t":"Don't buy this.","x":"Extremely unsatisfied in this product.  The fabric and texture of these makeup blenders is very harsh and ruff. Wouldn't recommend anybody to buy it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-15","r":5.0,"t":"Will buy again","x":"Smaller than I expected, which is fine.  They do expand when they're wet.  They work just as well as the ones I bought from Target for $6 each.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-16","r":1.0,"t":"These smell terrible. If you buy something that goes on your ...","x":"These smell terrible. If you buy something that goes on your face, it should probably smell half way decent. Will not buy again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"I'm a beginner but it really turned out well to say it's my first time using these type of sponges will be purchasing again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-18","r":3.0,"t":"Nice sponges but a little small.","x":"Sponges were nice but smaller than I expected. Weird smell too but I expected that. Arrived quickly though. Thank you!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-19","r":1.0,"t":"Never","x":"These all suck! They don't work how they should and some have dirt on them!! I do not recommend this product!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-20","r":5.0,"t":"Peggy","x":"I love these things and it makes blending so much easier then with the other ones I have tried.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-21","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"These aren't good what so ever. They don't absorb water, and anything you put on it slides off.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-22","r":2.0,"t":"They are really hard...","x":"They are super small and really hard. If you're looking for a softer applicator, this is not it","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-23","r":3.0,"t":"Bad smell","x":"They have have a horrible plastic smell that made it hard to use, I don't want it near my face","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01CZY0LKW-24","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"These were a very good purchase and worked great .My daughters were very happy with them...","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the sponges smaller than expected, though some like the size for detail work.","cites":[3,4,5,7,8,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers report an unpleasant odor, with some saying it persists even after washing.","cites":[1,10,12]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the softness and ease of use for applying makeup.","cites":[4,7,9,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the sponges do not expand when dampened.","cites":[1,2]},{"text":"Several reviewers mention shipping arriving earlier than expected.","cites":[1,4,7,14]}]},"qa":[]}